[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m According to Vieta's formulas, for a quadratic polynomial $x^2 + px + q$ with roots $r_1$ and $r_2$, the sum of the roots $r_1 + r_2 = -p$ and the product of the roots $r_1r_2 = q$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
