[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 5. **Calculate the volume of the cube:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m    - The volume \( V \) of a cube with side length \( s \) is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m      \[
