[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 1. The sum of the roots: $2a + b = -a$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 2. The product of the roots: $2a \cdot b = b$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m From the sum of the roots, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[2a + b = -a\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[3a + b = 0\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[b = -3a\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m From the product of the roots, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[2ab = b\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m If $b \neq 0$, we can divide both sides by $b$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[2a = 1\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[a = \frac{1}{2}\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Substituting $a = \frac{1}{2}$ into $b = -3a$, we get:
