[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m The equation of the second circle is \((x+6)^2 + (y+3)^2 = 49\). This is a circle with center \((-6, -3)\) and radius \(\sqrt{49} = 7\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
