[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Step 3: Solve the quadratic equation.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m We can factor the quadratic equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[x^2 - 6x + 5 = (x - 1)(x - 5) = 0\]
