[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \cot \theta = \frac{\cos \theta}{\sin \theta}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m For \(\theta = 90^\circ\), we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \cot 90^\circ = \frac{\cos 90^\circ}{\sin 90^\circ}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m From trigonometric values, we know that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
