[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m The power of a power rule states that \((x^m)^n = x^{mn}\). Here, \(x = a\), \(m = 2\), and \(n = 3\). Applying this rule, we get:
