[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m This is now in the standard form of a sphere's equation, where the center of the sphere is \((-2, 5, -1)\) and the radius is \(\sqrt{25} = 5\).
