[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 1. $r_1 + r_2 = -p$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 2. $r_1r_2 = q$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m In our case, the polynomial is $x^2 + ax + b$ with roots $2a$ and $b$. Therefore, we can write:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
