[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[ a_k = 5 + (k-1)(-2) = 5 - 2(k-1) = 7 - 2k. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m The $k^{th}$ term of the sequence $B$ is $2$ raised to the $k^{th}$ term of $A$. Thus, the $k^{th}$ term of $B$ is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[ b_k = 2^{a_k} = 2^{7-2k}. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m We need to find the sum of all terms of the sequence $B$. This sum is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[ S = \sum_{k=1}^{\infty} 2^{7-2k}. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m We can rewrite the sum as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[ S = 2^5 + 2^3 + 2^1 + 2^{-1} + 2^{-3} + \cdots. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
