[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Since the die roll and the coin toss are independent events, the probability of both events happening (i.e., winning the game on a single turn) is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
