[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m [response] Given $a = 8$, we want to find the value of $\left(16\sqrt[3]{a^2}\right)^{\frac 13}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m First, substitute $a = 8$ into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \left(16\sqrt[3]{8^2}\right)^{\frac 13}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Since $8^2 = 64$, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \left(16\sqrt[3]{64}\right)^{\frac 13}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Knowing that $\sqrt[3]{64} = 4$, the expression simplifies to:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \left(16 \cdot 4\right)^{\frac 13} = \left(64\right)^{\frac 13}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Since $64 = 4^3$, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \left(4^3\right)^{\frac 13} = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Therefore, the value is $\boxed{4}$.
