[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[1 = \sqrt{9} + 4,\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[1 = 3 + 4,\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[1 \neq 7.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
