[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Thus, the probability that the game will be won before the fourth turn is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \boxed{\frac{91}{216}}
