[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m The probability of not winning on a turn is $1 - \frac{1}{6} = \frac{5}{6}$. The game is won before the fourth turn if it is won on the first, second, or third turn. The probability of not winning in the first three turns is $\left(\frac{5}{6}\right)^3$. Therefore, the probability of winning before the fourth turn is $1 - \left(\frac{5}{6}\right)^3$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Calculating $\left(\frac{5}{6}\right)^3 = \frac{125}{216}$, we get the probability of winning before the fourth turn as $1 - \frac{125}{216} = \frac{216 - 125}{216} = \frac{91}{216}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Thus, the answer is \boxed{\frac{91}{216}}.
