[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m [response] To find out how many crab pots have three different colored balloons attached, we need to find the number of pots that are multiples of 4, 6, and 10 simultaneously. This means we are looking for the least common multiple (LCM) of 4, 6, and 10.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
