[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m $(x - 4)^2 = 11 - 2x$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Expanding the left side gives:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m $x^2 - 8x + 16 = 11 - 2x$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Rearranging all terms to one side of the equation yields:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m $x^2 - 6x + 5 = 0$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Factoring the quadratic equation, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m $(x - 5)(x - 1) = 0$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
