[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[x^2 + 3y^2 - 4x + 30y -2 = 0\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Rearrange the terms:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[x^2 - 4x + 3y^2 + 30y = 2\]
