[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m By symmetry and the properties of roots of unity, the sum can be shown to be equal to $\frac{23}{3}$, as each term in the sum contributes equally and the sum of all terms is invariant under the transformation of the roots.
