[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m we need to complete the square for each variable.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Starting with the \(x\)-terms, \(x^2 + 4x\), we add and subtract \(4\) (since \((4/2)^2 = 4\)), giving us \((x + 2)^2 - 4\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m For the \(y\)-terms, \(y^2 - 10y\), we add and subtract \(25\) (since \((-10/2)^2 = 25\)), giving us \((y - 5)^2 - 25\).
