[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m The probability of not winning on a turn is \(1 - \frac{1}{6} = \frac{5}{6}\). We want to find the probability of winning before the fourth turn, which means winning on the first, second, or third turn. This is equivalent to 1 minus the probability of not winning in the first three turns.
