[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m assistant
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m [response] We start by noting that $\sqrt[3]{2}$ is an irrational number between $1$ and $2$. Therefore, $a = 1$. This gives us the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[\sqrt[3]{2} = 1 + \cfrac{1}{b + \cfrac{1}{c + \cfrac{1}{d + \dotsb}}}.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Subtracting $1$ from both sides, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[\sqrt[3]{2} - 1 = \cfrac{1}{b + \cfrac{1}{c + \cfrac{1}{d + \dotsb}}}.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Taking the reciprocal of both sides, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[\cfrac{1}{\sqrt[3]{2} - 1} = b + \cfrac{1}{c + \cfrac{1}{d + \dotsb}}.\]
