[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m [response] Given $a = 8$, we need to find the value of $\left(16\sqrt[3]{a^2}\right)^{\frac 13}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m First, substitute $a = 8$ into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \left(16\sqrt[3]{8^2}\right)^{\frac 13}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
