[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Multiplying both sides by $2-y$ gives:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m x(2-y) = 1+y
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Expanding and rearranging terms:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m \[
