[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m Next, we consider the square root function, $\sqrt{\sin x}$. Since $\sin x$ ranges from $0$ to $1$, $\sqrt{\sin x}$ will range from $0$ to $1$ as well, but again excluding $0$ because $\sin x$ never actually reaches $0$ in the given interval. Thus, $\sqrt{\sin x} \in (0, 1]$.
