[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m The probability of not winning in a single turn is \(1 - \frac{1}{6} = \frac{5}{6}\). The game is won before the fourth turn if it is won in the first, second, or third turn. The probability of not winning in the first three turns is \(\left(\frac{5}{6}\right)^3\). Therefore, the probability of winning before the fourth turn is \(1 - \left(\frac{5}{6}\right)^3\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2059637)[0m 
